window.products.push({"id":1185096,"name":"AudioQuest Evergreen, 3.5-Millimeter Male to 3.5-Millimeter Male Cable, 2 Meters/6.56 Feet","category":"electronics","retail price":69.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ROZOnJlJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Solid Long-Grain Copper (LGC) conductors eliminate strand-interaction distortion. Evergreens solid Long-Grain Copper allows a smoother and clearer sound than cables using regular OFHC (Oxygen-Free High-Conductivity) copper. LGC has fewer oxides within the conducting material less impurities less grain boundaries and definitively better performance. Any solid material adjacent to a conductor is actually part of an imperfect circuit. Evergreen uses air-filled foamed-polyethylene insulation on both conductors because air absorbs next to no energy and polyethylene is low-loss and has a benign distortion profile. Metal-layer Noise-Dissipation System (NDS) prevents captured RF Interference from modulating the equipment’s ground reference. It prevents a significant amount of RFI from reaching the equipment’s ground plane. Purpose designed for single-ended applications, asymmetrical double-balanced geometry offers a relatively lower impedance on the ground for a richer and more dynamic experience. While many single-ended cable designs use a single path for both the ground and the shield, double-balanced designs separate the two for cleaner quieter performance. Cold-welded and gold-plated terminations plug design allows for a connection devoid of solder which is a common source of distortion. Because the ground shells are stamped instead of machined the metal can be chosen for low distortion instead of machinability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ROZOnJlJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AudioQuest","source_asin":"B076DWWTRM","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1185096","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076DWWTRM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B076DWWTRM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
