window.products.push({"id":1185274,"name":"Lensbaby Fisheye Optic","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8119oLMTFVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Turn your Lensbaby Composer or Composer Pro into a fun fisheye lens with the Fisheye Optic, part of the Lensbaby Optic Swap System. The Fisheye Optic’s ultra-wide 12mm focal length captures an eye-popping fisheye view from infinity all the way down to one inch away from the front of the lens. The Fisheye Optic is designed for use with the Composer, Composer Pro, or the Scout. This optic does not benefit from being tilted. From the Manufacturer The Fisheye Adapter allows you to turn your Lensbaby Muse and Control Freak into a fun fisheye lens with the Fisheye Optic, part of the Lensbaby Optic Swap System.   The Fisheye Optic's ultra-wide 12mm focal length captures an eye-popping fisheye view from infinity all the way down to one half of an inch (1.3cm) away from the front of the lens (and zero inches from the front of the lens when used with the Control Freak). The Fisheye Muse Adapter is required to use the Fisheye Optic with the Muse and Control Freak. (No adapter is required to use the Fisheye Optic with the Composer). The Fisheye Optic has limited functionality (is best suited for macro work, as the metal rods are often visible when focusing from 3 inches to infinity) when used with the Control Freak. The Fisheye Adapter ships with a hex key to easily remove the standard adapter that comes installed on the Fisheye Optic and replace it with the Fisheye Adapter. Fisheye Adapter Product Specs The Fisheye Adapter makes the Fisheye Optic compatible with the Lensbaby Muse and Control Freak (the Fisheye Optic has limited functionality--it is best suited for macro work--when used with the Control Freak) The Fisheye Adapter makes the Fisheye Optic compatible with the Lensbaby Muse and Control Freak (the Fisheye Optic has limited functionality--it is best suited for macro work--when used with the Control Freak) Ships with a hex key to easily remove the standard Fisheye Optic adapter and replace it with the Fisheye Adapter Ships with a hex key to easily remove the standard Fisheye Optic adapter and replace it with the Fisheye Adapter Recommended Lensbaby Accessories for use with Fisheye Adapter Fisheye Optic (LBOFE) Fisheye Optic (LBOFE) Lensbaby Muse (LBM2C, LBM2N, LBM2S, PBM2P, LBM2O) Lensbaby Muse (LBM2C, LBM2N, LBM2S, PBM2P, LBM2O) Lensbaby Control Freak (LBCFC, LBCFN, LBCFS, LBCFP, LBCFO) Lensbaby Control Freak (LBCFC, LBCFN, LBCFS, LBCFP, LBCFO) Fisheye Adapter Box Contents Fisheye Adapter Fisheye Adapter Hex key Hex key Instructions Instructions","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8119oLMTFVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lensbaby","source_asin":"B002TG3XXY","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1185274","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002TG3XXY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B002TG3XXY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
