window.products.push({"id":1185349,"name":"Sony Bravia S-Series KDL-32S2400 32-Inch Digital LCD HDTV","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JmaGlf9ES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description BRAVIA S2400 LCD televisions use Sony's BRAVIA Engine full digital video processor for crisp and clear images. Several special picture enhancement technologies are integrated into the processor to create better gradations and details, enhance contrast, dynamically improve color, and reduce image flicker. Amazon.com Experience a more dynamic and vibrant picture with the 32\" BRAVIA digital LCD television. New features such as the dynamic backlighting system called ACE (Advanced Contrast Enhancement) automatically adjust the intensity of the backlight for improved contrast. In addition, a built-in Light Sensor intelligently fine-tunes the screen brightness to match the ambient light in your room ensuring a comfortable viewing experience. The KDL-32S2400 features enhanced connectivity via HDMI input and PC input through HDMI providing quality playback of nearly every connected device. Feature List Advanced Contrast Enhancer (ACE) Function: The Advanced Contrast Enhancer (ACE) builds on Sony's excellent on-contrast ratio performance. A Dynamic Contrast Ratio of up to 5000:11 is achieved by using real-time image processing to adjust the contrast along with optimizing backlight levels. But rather than focus on the \"numbers\", Sony focuses on actual picture performance avoiding exaggerated blacks where detail can be lost. ACE translates to blacker blacks in darker scenes, as well as better shadow detail in other scenes for a difference that you can see. BRAVIA Engine Full Digital Video Processor: The BRAVIA S2400 LCD televisions use the BRAVIA Engine full digital video processor for crisp and clear images. Several special picture enhancement technologies are integrated into the processor to create better gradations and details, enhance contrast, dynamically improve color, and reduce image flicker. HDMI and PC Connectivity: Designed for maximum versatility, the BRAVIA S-Series Digital LCD TV line is equipped with a comprehensive range of input interfaces. The HDMI (High-Definition Multimedia Interface) is the first industry-supported, uncompressed, all-digital audio/video interface. HDMI technology supports enhanced or High Definition video, together with multi-channel digital audio to provide matchless image and sound reproduction. The PC input (HD-15-pin) offers easy connection to your PC, allowing you to use your high resolution BRAVIA S-Series Digital TV as a computer monitor2. Light Sensor Intelligently adjusts the screen brightness to match the ambient light in a room, ensuring a comfortable viewing experience. In a dim room for example the screen automatically reduces brightness making it much more comfortable for viewing. SRS® TruSurround® XT: Building on the success of TruSurround technology, TruSurround XT audio adds three new audio enhancement technologies to produce an amazingly immersive sound experience. Dialog Clarity brings movie dialog into \"focus\" during the playback of any surround-encoded material to make speech much clearer and crisper. TruBass creates incredible deep rich bass allowing a person to perceive significantly deeper, richer low bass tones that are far beyond the physical low frequency capabilities of the speaker itself. And WOW widens the soundstage by processing standard two-channel stereo material as well as multi-channel encoded material for a dramatic improvement in the playback of any stereo audio over a two-speaker system. Freeze Function: Freeze Function is a useful function that allows you to temporarily freeze the picture in a separate screen while the programming continues to display. This comes in handy when you want to copy a recipe, phone number, etc. that flashes too quickly across your screen. Simply touch the \"Freeze\" button on the remote control and copy the details down at your convenience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JmaGlf9ES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sony","source_asin":"B000I7VKRC","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1185349","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000I7VKRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000I7VKRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
