window.products.push({"id":1185618,"name":"QUADPORT 4 Port USB 3.0 Hub, USB C Hub or USB A Hub, Perfect for Laptops, PCs, Macs, Xbox, PS5 and More! Includes USB Extender and Cable (USB Type-A)","category":"electronics","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pfNedc-gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The QuadPort Hub is the ultimate data transfer companion for anyone who wants to transfer their files in style. With four high-speed USB ports, you can transfer all your favorite photos, videos, and documents with ease, and in no time at all! Say goodbye to the days of slow data transfers and hello to the future of fast and fun data transfer. The plug-and-play design of the QuadPort Hub means you can get started right away, without any complicated installations or drivers. Just plug it in and get to transferring all your amazing files in no time! Whether you're at home, in the office, or on the go, the QuadPort Hub is always ready for action. The QuadPort Hub comes in two options, with either a USB Type-C or a USB Type-A connector, so you can choose the one that works best for you and your devices. No matter what device you have, the QuadPort Hub is the ultimate data transfer sidekick. Whether you're using a laptop, tablet, or smartphone, the QuadPort Hub has got you covered. With 5GB/s upstream bandwidth, the QuadPort Hub is a data transfer powerhouse! Upload multiple files at once, or send a large file quickly, and you'll be done before you know it. The QuadPort Hub is a game changer, and it's sure to make your data transfer experience fun and exciting. The compact and portable design of the QuadPort Hub makes it the perfect data transfer solution for anyone who's always on the go. Its small size and lightweight design make it easy to carry around with you, so you can transfer data wherever you go. Whether you're traveling for work or play, the QuadPort Hub is always by your side, ready for action. So why settle for a boring data transfer solution when you can have one that's fast, fun, and fabulous? The QuadPort Hub is the ultimate choice for anyone who wants to transfer their files in style. Get your QuadPort Hub today and start transferring data like a pro!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pfNedc-gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QuadPort Hub","source_asin":"B0BW4WHBXR","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1185618","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW4WHBXR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW4WHBXR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
