window.products.push({"id":1185713,"name":"Skinomi Screen Protector Compatible with Sony Smartwatch (6-Pack) Clear TechSkin TPU Anti-Bubble HD Film","category":"electronics","retail price":6.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41twngLEm9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Protect your Investment Daily use of your mobile device can cause unsightly scratches, dents, and other unwanted damage. Within a few months, the screen will be difficult to read; the device will decrease in resale value and be embarrassing to show other people. Lower-quality disposable screen protectors seem like a temporary solution for keeping your device looking brand new; though they need constant replacements. The Only Screen Protector You'll Need With this problem in mind the founders of Skinomi set out to create a screen protector that's tough, reliable, and long-lasting. Their solution was the Skinomi TechSkin. Made of a thermoplastic urethane film that is designed to resist abrasion, the TechSkin Screen Protector compatible with the Sony Smartwatch provides impact absorbing military-grade protection for your device. The protector is UV resistant, HD Clear, and goes on invisible. A smooth texture and feel makes it easy to navigate your device as if there was nothing applied. The flexible high-grade film is formulated to be \"self-healing\" which makes it able to stretch, absorb, and even repair scratches and impact damage. Lifetime Guarantee We're so confident that you'll love the TechSkin that every Screen Protector comes with a Lifetime Warranty . If the Skinomi TechSkin wears off, we will replace it. The anti-bubble installation process is easy and error-proof. Protect your possessions and never worry about having to replace that old screen protector again. Skinomi Kit Includes: Skinomi TechSkin Screen Protector Skinomi TechSkin Screen Protector High Grade Lint-less Microfiber Cloth High Grade Lint-less Microfiber Cloth Installation Solution Installation Solution Lifetime Warranty Lifetime Warranty Made in the USA Made in the USA Skinomi TechSkin Screen Protector compatible with Sony Smartwatch Skinomi TechSkin Screen Protector compatible with Sony Smartwatch","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41twngLEm9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Skinomi","source_asin":"B007V7GNPG","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1185713","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007V7GNPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B007V7GNPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
