window.products.push({"id":1185757,"name":"Speck Products CandyShell Card Case for iPhone 4/4S - 1 Pack - Carrying Case - White/Peacock","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314aI8x5hlL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Leave your wallet or purse at home with this convenient and ingenious iPhone 4S (or iPhone 4) card case! The CandyShell Card is a protective, one-piece iPhone case that lets you stash up to three credit-card-sized cards inside its built-in rubberized slot. Just slide your cards in to store them securely, and use the handy thumb release to access your cards when you need them! Like all the CandyShells, the CandyShell Card features two protective layers in one great looking case. The rubberized interior and button covers offer shock absorption, while the hard matte outer shell provides durable protection against scratches and dings. From the Manufacturer CandyShell Card lets you hold up to 3 credit-sized cards (or folded bills) securely in its built-in slot--so you can skip the wallet, or leave the purse at home. A handy thumb release makes it easy to access your cards when you need them. Patent-pending co-molded construction. View larger Sweet functional variations in the CandyShell family. View larger Ultra Protection Speck's CandyShell cases all feature a unique, co-molded design. A hard outer shell is combined with a resilient, rubbery interior, button covers and raised screen bezel (to protect the screen). The design provides extra shock absorbency to protect your iPhone from those occasional drops. Sweet Looks With its bold two-toned color patterns and matte finish, CandyShell Card just looks flat-out sweet. And it's available in a wide array of color combinations, so you can find a case that suits your personal style. Skip The Wallet or Purse This clever case is perfect for the times when you don't want to drag around a big bulky wallet or a heavy purse. And of course, it's plenty protective, too. More Sweet CandyShell Cases CandyShell now comes in several varieties, including CandyShell Satin with scuff-resistant matte \"soft-touch\" coating, CandyShell Card with built-in card slot so you can skip the wallet or purse, and the ultra-grippy CandyShell Grip for gamers and heavy texters. There's also CandyShell View with a built-in viewing stand and CandyShell Flip with a flip-back panel to making docking with your iPhone a snap. (All sold separately.) About Speck Founded by a group of creative design engineers, Speck makes form-fitting and delightfully functional cases designed to protect and enhance your smartphones, iPods, MacBooks, and tablets. Speck designers are excited by technology, fanatical about gadgets, highly detail-oriented, and obsessed with creating top-quality, fun-to-use products that people love. CandyShell is Available in These Sweet Varieties Speck CandyShell and functional variations CandyShell CandyShell Satin CandyShell Grip CandyShell Flip CandyShell Card CandyShell View Construction and Function: Glossy one-piece hard shell with rubbery lining, buttons and bezel CandyShell protection plus soft-touch finish adds elegance and comfort CandyShell protection plus finger grips for gaming, texting and comfortable, secure hold CandyShell protection plus flip-back panel for docking without removing the case CandyShell protection plus side-loading slot securely holds 1 - 3 cards plus cash CandyShell protection plus integrated spring-loaded kickstand for FaceTime and videos Key Feature Ultra Protection Soft-Touch Comfort Fingerpads for Control Flips for Docking Holds up to 3 Cards Retractable Kickstand Find a Speck Case That's the Right Fit for You Protect what matters MightyVault CandyShell FabShell PixelSkin HD Fitted Construction and Finish Matte finish one-piece hard case with grippy band and detachable belt clip holster/stand Glossy one-piece hard shell with rubbery lining, buttons and bezel Fabric-wrapped one-piece hard shell with grippy bezel Slim-fitting one-piece flexible case; matte finish with glossy details Form-fitting fabric backed two-piece hard shell Protection Level Maximum Protection Ultra Protection Super Protection Extra Protection Strong Protection Hard Protection Soft Protection Screen Protection Raised screen plate with home button cover, plus screen protector film Raised Bezel Raised Bezel Raised Bezel Raised Bezel Materials Hard polycarbonate with rubbery TPE lining, silicone grip band Hard polycarbonate with shock-absorbent TPE lining Hard polycarbonate with flexible TPU bezel and corners + fabric back and sides Flexible TPU Hard polycarbonate with fabric backing Available Colors Several two-tone color combinations Wide variety of vibrant, two-tone color combinations Many fashionable fabric patterns Black, gray and many vibrant color options Many fashionable fabric patterns Warranty 1 year 1 year 1 year 1 year 1 year","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314aI8x5hlL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Speck","source_asin":"B005T0DXTG","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1185757","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005T0DXTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B005T0DXTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
