window.products.push({"id":1185798,"name":"Buffalo MiniStation Cobalt 500GB SuperSpeed USB 3.0 Portable Hard Drive with TurboPC HD-PE500U3/BK (Black)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q8Qd-kUvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description MiniStation Cobalt USB 3.0 is the latest generation of Buffalo’s external storage solutions, delivering interface speeds 10 times faster than USB 2.0. Designed for mobility, MiniStation Cobalt HD-PEU3 can store and move tons of photo, video, music and data files at previously unavailable speeds in a compact and lightweight form, perfect for travel. Plus, the Cobalt is backward-compatible with USB 2.0 and it works with PC and Mac , so you can access your files from nearly any computer. Included with the Cobalt is Buffalo Tools, a feature-rich suite of PC performance enhancement tools. With Buffalo Tools, users can boost transfer performance by an additional 20% using TurboPC, conserve energy and battery consumption by utilizing ECO Manager and back up PCs with the easy to use Buffalo's Backup Utility. With a variety of capacities available, you can quickly back up massive amounts of important digital assets at super speeds. From the Manufacturer Buffalo's MiniStation Cobalt USB 3.0 Portable Hard Drive is a lightweight storage solution that offers the latest in USB technology, boasting speeds of up to 5 Gbps. The Cobalt’s compact, contemporary design is ideal for users who need high-speed USB powered storage for the storage and transportation of digital content. SuperSpeed USB 3.0 MiniStation Cobalt USB 3.0 is the latest generation of Buffalo’s ultra portable external storage solutions. Ideal for the active individual, MiniStation Cobalt HD-PEU3 can store and move tons of photo, video, music and data files at rapid speeds in a compact and lightweight form, designed for travel. SuperSpeed USB 3.0 offers maximum transfer speeds of up to 5 Gbps*, an amazing 10 times faster than USB 2.0. USB 2.0 Compatibility The MiniStation Cobalt USB 3.0 storage solution is backward-compatible with all USB 2.0 enabled desktop computers and notebooks. Simply plug the cable into the USB 2.0 port and you are connected – no additional hardware is required. With a variety of capacities available, the MiniStation Cobalt with SuperSpeed USB gives users the ability to quickly back-up massive amounts of important data and other digital assets across multiple platforms and USB interfaces. Upgrade Your Computer to USB 3.0 In conjunction with the SuperSpeed USB MiniStation Cobalt, Buffalo has released two interface card adapters for an instant USB 3.0 upgrade. The USB 3.0 PCI Express Interface Card IFC-PCIE2U3 for PCs and the USB 3.0 ExpressCard Adapter IFC-EC2U3/UC for laptops allow users to upgrade their computers to utilize SuperSpeed USB technology for the fastest USB data transfer speeds ever. Plus, each adapter card has two USB 3.0 ports for two simultaneous SuperSpeed connections. Compact and Convenient Designed for mobility, the Cobalt’s compact contemporary design occupies minimal space and offers SuperSpeed USB 3.0 powered mobile storage for your data and for your on-the-go lifestyle. Plus, the Cobalt works with PC and Mac® so you can access your files from whichever computer you are on. Backup and Manage Your Files with Buffalo Tools Buffalo Tools is a feature-rich suite of optional software included on many Buffalo DriveStation and MiniStation storage products. Any or all of the following components of Buffalo Tools may be installed on Windows® PCs. TurboPC: Using your PC’s high speed RAM, TurboPC can increase file transfer rates by up to 25% over competing USB 3.0 portable hard drives. TurboPC also includes TurboCopy which provides additional system adjustments to increase performance substantially. Buffalo’s Backup Utility: An easy-to-use and fully featured backup software for Windows PCs and can be used to back up one or multiple computers with a single Buffalo external hard drive. ECO Manager: Energy efficiency tool conserves energy and reduces battery consumption by regulating the power usage of the hard drive, cutting power to the drive during extended periods of inactivity. RAMDISK: A simple utility that allows you to create a RAM disk on your Windows PC which creates a small, but extremely fast environment to work on files in. SecureLock: Software that provides complete control of the data encryption on your Buffalo external hard drive, providing password protection and software data encryption. Use the MiniStation Cobalt on your Mac or PC; it is the perfect “grab-and-go” storage solution, whether you’re carrying your favorite tunes or an important business presentation. Plus, with Buffalo’s TurboPC technology, you can transfer files up to 25 % faster than other standard USB 3.0 portable hard drives. The Cobalt is a quick and secure way to store and transport data from place to place. Key Features and Benefits SuperSpeed USB 3.0: Provides accelerated file access and increased transfer speeds of up to 5 Gbps* SuperSpeed USB 3.0: Provides accelerated file access and increased transfer speeds of up to 5 Gbps* Compatible with USB 2.0 and 3.0: Support for legacy USB 2.0 and SuperSpeed 3.0 Compatible with ","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q8Qd-kUvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BUFFALO","source_asin":"B003CJTQKG","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1185798","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003CJTQKG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B003CJTQKG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
