window.products.push({"id":1185882,"name":"Honor Watch GS Pro Smart Watch, 1.39\" AMOLED 5ATM Waterproof 25 Days Standby Smart Bracelet with Bluetooth GPS Fitness Runing Watch (White)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ELhbZCbFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⌚【1.39\" AMOLED Display&14 Types of MIL-STD-810G Tests】HONOR Watch GS Pro sports fitness watch adopting 1.39-inch AMOLED color screen display give you vivid visual field and fine finger touching feel. Complied with 14 types of MIL-STD-810G tests, including Low Pressure (Altitude), High Temperature, Low Temperature, Temperature Shock, etc. (Prolonged exposure is not recommended as it may damage the watch and its components.)Suitable for all kinds of weather, it is a high-quality sports watch. ⌚【Super Long Endurance】HONOR Watch GS Pro can endure up to 25 days. Even with the outdoor GPS mode on, it's still good for up to 100 hours. Adventurers don't need to worry about running out of battery anymore when exploring the wild.(The typical scenario comes based on using habits. The actual battery life varies depending on how user uses the watch and how often they use the watch) ⌚【SpO2 Function & Stress Monitoring & Breathing Exercise】HONOR Watch GS Pro has everything you need for a comprehensive view of your health - from 24/7 heart rate monitoring, all-night sleep tracking, to even SpO2 monitor for blood oxygen level measurements.Your watch supports tracking your stress 24 hours a day. The watch is equipped with an optical heart rate sensor to track your stress and provides stress readings for you to better understand your physical condition. ⌚【Super Fitness Modes】100 Different Workout Modes, No matter you are into outdoor or indoor workouts, there is something for you. Whichever kind of athlete you are, and whichever sports you like, we have something for you. HONOR Watch GS Pro features a total of over 15 professional workout modes and 85 customised workout modes helping you to stay active and engaged.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ELhbZCbFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mxiqqpltky","source_asin":"B08JX7WZ2P","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1185882","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JX7WZ2P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JX7WZ2P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1185883,"name":"Sanoxy SANOXY_ FM-Trans FM Stereo Transmitter/Car Charger/Holder for iPod with Remote Control and Handsfree Feature (Black)","category":"electronics","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nvwxT6BIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hi-Fi FM stereo transmitter allows you to fully enjoy your music. Cigarette Lighter power supply mode. for iPhone3g 3gs 4 4s/iPod/MP3 etc. charging and FM transmitter simultaneously. Support most Smart Phone / GPS / MP3 / MP4 and other device charging with output USB socket. LCD frequency display with backlight for easy to read display. Arch design, with 180 degree rotation. quality silicone fixer prevents the this products from rotating. flexible goose-pipe makes it convenient to find the best position for your device. With rotation prevention design keeps your devices steady & firm in its position. With Remote Specifications: stereo Range:88.1-107.9MHz Interval:0.1MHz :10ppm(-10℃+55℃) & Harmonic: -60dB Voltage: DC 12V24V USB Output Voltage: DC 5V/800mA Separation: 40dB Response:20Hz16KHz Distortion: 0.1%(F=75KHz,f=1KHz) :≥45dB(1KHz 100%) Effective: 5m Remote Control Range: about 3m Operating Guide 1. Insert the cigarette power adapter into the car's cigarette lighter. Now adjust this products to a suitable position and then put your device onto the cradle. Press \"UP\" or \"DOWN\" button to adjust the frequency you wish to use or press the \"QS\" button to use the default frequency. 2. Turn on the cars FM radio band and adjust to the frequency as set on this products. Work with iPod 1. Place the iPod on this products cradle, and adjust the cradle to hold the iPod securely. 2. Connect the iPod to this products 8 pin connector. Now use the 3.5 stereo cable to connect the iPod and this products for Audio. Work with iPhone 1. Adjust the cradle to fit the iPhone securely. and Connect the iPhone to this products 30pin connector. 2. Now use the 3.5 stereo cable to connect the iPhone and this products for audio. 3.You can select to talk or continue to enjoy music through car speaker. Accessory only; iPhone not included. Not endorsed by Apple, iPod, iPhone are registered trademarks of Apple, Inc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nvwxT6BIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SANOXY","source_asin":"B00XIQTGBW","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1185883","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XIQTGBW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XIQTGBW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
